    <ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock id="f-256" contextRef="c-02">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; line-height: 15.6933px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-weight: bolder"&gt;Basis of Accounting&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Kuparuk Transportation Company is subject to regulation by the Federal Energy Regulatory Commission (FERC). The accounting policies followed in preparation of these financial statements generally conform to those required by FERC.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; line-height: 15.6933px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-weight: bolder"&gt;Accounting for Partner Capital&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Kuparuk Transportation Company is organized as a partnership under the partnership laws of the State of Alaska. Partnerships do not have capital stock and retained income, but rather combined partner capital and undistributed earnings are captured in FERC account 70, Capital Stock.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; line-height: 15.6933px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif"&gt;Page 119, Unappropriated Retained Income Statement, is not included in the financial reports provided because there is no balance in Account 75, Unappropriated Retained Income, which Page 119 supports.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style="margin: 0 0 8pt; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 1); font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0; white-space: normal; line-height: 15.6933px; font-size: 11pt; font-family: Calibri, sans-serif"&gt;&lt;b style="font-weight: bolder"&gt;Page 700 Not Included with This Submission&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Page 700 is not included with this report as it is not required. Pipelines comprising the Trans-Alaska Pipeline System (TAPS) and any pipeline delivering oil directly to or indirectly into the TAPS are excluded from Page 700 reporting requirements.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:NotesToFinancialStatementsTextBlock>
